Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That in the end we stand all alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.49,0:00:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,knowing our turn will come one day. We get no help on that journey;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,we must make it alone with the tools we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But the best way to prepare is to understand why we ended up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.73,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,why we of all people were given a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my sermon is over now. I won't keep you any longer.
